cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper."
title: "GWi+ODPS: Imaginary-Only Gabor Wavelet with Orientation-Aware Double-Peak Suppression for Edge Detection"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation and evaluation pipeline for an imaginary-only
  Gabor wavelet edge detector (GWi) with orientation-aware double-peak
  suppression (ODPS) post-processing. Evaluated on BSDS500, BIPED v2,
  and UDED benchmarks. The imaginary-only formulation halves the
  convolution count of complex Gabor, running 2.2x faster while
  improving ODS by 0.05-0.15. ODPS adds 0.014-0.038 ODS at runtime
  parity with complex Gabor.
